aramilitary operative, is presumed dead and teams up with reclusive billionaire Finch to prevent violent crimes in New York City by initiating their own type of justice. With the special training that Reese has had in Covert Operations and Finch's genius software inventing mind, the two are a perfect match for the job that they have to complete. With the help of surveillance equipment, they work \"outside the law\" and get the right criminal behind bars. ","releaseInfo":"2011","genres":["English"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvUG9kLXByaWtyaXRpZS0lMjhVbmRlcmNvdmVyJTI5LSUyOFRWLVNlcmllcy0yMDExLSUyOS8","type":"series","name":"Pod prikritie (Undercover)","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/evIjfFZrqGW9gUkQr4Lh3lEDg5p.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/k0ORSGA1WfN6iOvXcJDstFWm5GU.jpg","description":"Just an ordinary boy from the Sofia suburbs becomes the first bulgarian undercover cop. Forced by his father when he was young to lie and cheat, Martin becomes the perfect liar. That skill, and also the hatred of the 'underworld' makes him the perfect match for a dangerous mission - to infiltrate the crime organisation of a rich and powerful businessman. While infiltrating and living in fear of being uncovered, Martin falls in love with the most inappropriate woman - Djaro's girlfriend, Suni. Just when he gains the trust of the mobsters, it appears that the real enemy is in the police. Martin is alone against all, facing difficult decisions.","releaseInfo":"2011","genres":["English"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvUmV2ZW5nZS0lMjhUVi1TZXJpZXMtMjAxMS0lMjktNzIwcC8","type":"series","name":"Revenge 720p","description":"Folder: English","releaseInfo":"2011","genres":["English"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvU2hhbWVsZXNzJTIwJTI4MjAxMSUyOS8","type":"series","name":"Shameless","poster":"https://im